msgid "E-Mail"
msgstr "Email"

msgid "Einladungscode"
msgstr "Invitation code"

msgid ""
"Ich akzeptiere die Nutzungsbedingungen von Tourchef inklusive "
"Auftragsbearbeitung."
msgstr ""
"I accept Tourchef's terms of use, including the data processing agreement."

msgid "Bitte akzeptiere die Nutzungsbedingungen."
msgstr "Please accept the terms of use."

msgid "Ungültiger Einladungscode."
msgstr "Invalid invitation code."

msgid ""
"Erscheint in der Widget-Adresse. Nur Kleinbuchstaben, Zahlen und "
"Bindestriche."
msgstr ""
"Appears in the widget address. Lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only."

msgid ""
"Websites, auf denen dein Widget eingebettet werden darf, z. B. "
"https://www.mein-bergfuehrer.ch (eine pro Zeile). Leer = überall erlaubt."
msgstr ""
"Websites allowed to embed your widget, e.g. https://www.mein-bergfuehrer.ch "
"(one per line). Empty = anywhere."

#, python-format
msgid "Ungültige Adresse: %(url)s (Beispiel: https://www.example.ch)"
msgstr "Invalid address: %(url)s (example: https://www.example.ch)"

msgid "Ungültige IBAN (Beispiel: CH93 0076 2011 6238 5295 7)."
msgstr "Invalid IBAN (example: CH93 0076 2011 6238 5295 7)."

msgid "Muss kleiner oder gleich der kostenlosen Frist sein."
msgstr "Must be less than or equal to the free period."

msgid ""
"Google Kalender: Einstellungen → dein Kalender → «Privatadresse im iCal-"
"Format». Belegte Tage werden automatisch für Anfragen gesperrt."
msgstr ""
"Google Calendar: Settings → your calendar → \"Secret address in iCal "
"format\". Busy days are blocked for requests automatically."

msgid "Die Adresse muss mit https:// beginnen."
msgstr "The address must start with https://."

msgid "Code aus der App"
msgstr "Code from the app"

msgid "6 Ziffern – oder einer deiner Wiederherstellungscodes."
msgstr "6 digits – or one of your recovery codes."

msgid "Passwort"
msgstr "Password"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Name"

msgid "Telefon"
msgstr "Phone"

msgid "Steht in der Bestätigung an angemeldete Gäste."
msgstr "Shown in the confirmation to registered guests."

msgid "Sprache"
msgstr "Language"

msgid "Sprache des Dashboards und deiner E-Mails."
msgstr "Language of the dashboard and your emails."

msgid "Widget-Kennung"
msgstr "Widget ID"

msgid "Mindestvorlauf (Tage)"
msgstr "Minimum notice (days)"

msgid "Buchbar im Voraus (Tage)"
msgstr "Bookable in advance (days)"

msgid "Tagesansatz Bergführer (CHF)"
msgstr "Guide day rate (CHF)"

msgid ""
"Tagesansatz für kleine Gruppen; für grössere Gruppen legst du unten Stufen "
"fest. Vorgabe im Preisrechner, auch für einen zweiten Bergführer."
msgstr ""
"Day rate for small groups; set tiers below for larger groups. Default in the"
" price calculator, also for a second guide."

msgid "Tagesansatz Aspirant (CHF)"
msgstr "Aspirant day rate (CHF)"

msgid "Vorgabe im Preisrechner."
msgstr "Default in the price calculator."

msgid "IBAN für Überweisungen"
msgstr "IBAN for bank transfers"

msgid "Steht auf der Rechnung, damit Gäste überweisen können."
msgstr "Shown on the invoice so guests can pay by bank transfer."

msgid "MWST-Nummer"
msgstr "VAT number"

msgid ""
"Nur wenn du mehrwertsteuerpflichtig bist, z. B. CHE-123.456.789 MWST. "
"Rechnungen und Belege weisen dann die MWST aus."
msgstr ""
"Only if you are VAT-registered, e.g. CHE-123.456.789 MWST. Invoices and "
"receipts then show the VAT."

msgid "MWST-Satz (%)"
msgstr "VAT rate (%)"

msgid "Deine Preise verstehen sich inklusive MWST."
msgstr "Your prices include VAT."

msgid "Kostenlos stornierbar bis (Tage vor Tourbeginn)"
msgstr "Free cancellation until (days before the start)"

msgid "Teilweise Kosten bis (Tage vor Tourbeginn)"
msgstr "Partial charge until (days before the start)"

msgid "Storno-Kosten in dieser Zeit (%)"
msgstr "Cancellation charge in this period (%)"

msgid "Danach 100 %. Bei einer Absage wegen Wetter oder durch dich: 0 %."
msgstr "After that 100 %. If you call it off or the weather does: 0 %."

msgid "Eigene Bedingungen für Gäste"
msgstr "Your own terms for guests"

msgid ""
"Optional. Ersetzt den Text der Tourchef-Vorlage; Gäste akzeptieren ihn bei "
"jeder Anfrage und Anmeldung. Die automatische Rückzahlung richtet sich "
"weiterhin nach den Storno-Stufen oben."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Replaces the Tourchef template text; guests accept it with every "
"request and sign-up. Automatic refunds still follow the cancellation tiers "
"above."

msgid "iCal-Adresse"
msgstr "iCal address"

msgid "Erlaubte Websites"
msgstr "Allowed websites"

msgid "ab Personen"
msgstr "from persons"

msgid "Tagesansatz (CHF)"
msgstr "Day rate (CHF)"

msgid "Buchung mit Kontaktdaten angesehen"
msgstr "Viewed booking with contact details"

msgid "Teilnehmerliste mit Notfallkontakten angesehen"
msgstr "Viewed participant list with emergency contacts"

msgid "Export heruntergeladen"
msgstr "Downloaded export"

msgid "Personendaten gelöscht"
msgstr "Deleted personal data"

msgid "Pilot-Auswertung angesehen"
msgstr "Viewed pilot evaluation"

msgid "Zu viele Anmeldeversuche. Bitte in 15 Minuten erneut versuchen."
msgstr "Too many login attempts. Please try again in 15 minutes."

msgid "Zu viele Versuche. Bitte später erneut versuchen."
msgstr "Too many attempts. Please try again later."

msgid "Willkommen! Richte zuerst die Zwei-Faktor-Anmeldung ein."
msgstr "Welcome! First set up two-factor login."

msgid "Zu viele Versuche. Bitte in 5 Minuten erneut versuchen."
msgstr "Too many attempts. Please try again in 5 minutes."

msgid "Der Code stimmt nicht."
msgstr "The code is not correct."

msgid "Der Code stimmt nicht. Prüfe die Uhrzeit deines Handys."
msgstr "The code is not correct. Check your phone's clock."

msgid "Passwort oder Code stimmt nicht."
msgstr "Password or code is not correct."

msgid ""
"Für ausgeschriebene Termine brauchst du Online-Zahlungen: Verbinde zuerst "
"Stripe in den Einstellungen."
msgstr ""
"Scheduled dates need online payments: connect Stripe in the settings first."

msgid "Das Ende muss nach dem Beginn liegen."
msgstr "The end must be after the start."

msgid "Der Termin muss in der Zukunft liegen."
msgstr "The date must be in the future."

msgid "Die Höchstzahl muss mindestens so gross sein wie die Mindestzahl."
msgstr "The maximum must be at least the minimum."

msgid "Anmeldeschluss und Entscheid-Frist müssen in der Zukunft liegen."
msgstr "Signup deadline and decision deadline must be in the future."

msgid "Anmeldeschluss und Entscheid-Frist müssen vor dem Tourbeginn liegen."
msgstr "Signup deadline and decision deadline must be before the tour starts."

msgid ""
"Datum und Preis lassen sich nicht mehr ändern, weil schon Gäste angemeldet "
"sind. Für ein neues Datum: Termin verschieben."
msgstr ""
"Date and price can no longer change because guests have signed up. For a new"
" date: move the date."

msgid "Die Höchstzahl ist kleiner als die bereits vergebenen Plätze."
msgstr "The maximum is lower than the seats already taken."

msgid "Bitte gib ein gültiges Ersatzdatum in der Zukunft an."
msgstr "Please give a valid replacement date in the future."

#, python-format
msgid "Höchstens CHF %(max)s können noch zurückbezahlt werden."
msgstr "At most CHF %(max)s can still be refunded."

msgid "Für diesen Termin sind keine Anmeldungen mehr möglich."
msgstr "Sign-ups are no longer possible for this date."

msgid "Bitte mindestens einen Platz wählen."
msgstr "Please choose at least one seat."

#, python-format
msgid "Leider sind nur noch %(n)s Plätze frei."
msgstr "Sorry, only %(n)s seats are left."

msgid "Es sind Plätze frei – du kannst dich direkt anmelden."
msgstr "There are free seats – you can sign up directly."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Tourchef – Buchungen für Bergführer\n"
"Datenschutz: {privacy_url}"
msgstr ""
"Tourchef – bookings for mountain guides\n"
"Privacy: {privacy_url}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Neue Anfrage für {dates}"
msgstr "New request for {dates}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"Du hast eine neue Anfrage erhalten:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guest_contact}\n"
"\n"
"Tourenwunsch:\n"
"{guest_message}\n"
"\n"
"Bitte antworte bis {deadline}, sonst verfällt die Anfrage:\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"You have a new request:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guest_contact}\n"
"\n"
"Tour wish:\n"
"{guest_message}\n"
"\n"
"Please reply by {deadline}, otherwise the request expires:\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deine Anfrage bei {guide}"
msgstr "Your request to {guide}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Deine Anfrage ist bei {guide} eingegangen:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} antwortet bis {deadline}. Du erhältst eine E-Mail. Status jederzeit hier:\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} has received your request:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} will reply by {deadline}. You will get an email. Check the status any time:\n"
"{guest_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deine Tour am {start} ist bestätigt"
msgstr "Your tour on {start} is confirmed"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} hat deine Anfrage bestätigt:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{breakdown}{guide_note}\n"
"{billing_hint}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} has confirmed your request:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{breakdown}{guide_note}\n"
"{billing_hint}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Neuer Vorschlag von {guide}"
msgstr "New proposal from {guide}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} schlägt dir Folgendes vor:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{breakdown}{guide_note}\n"
"Annehmen oder ablehnen bis {deadline}:\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} proposes the following:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{breakdown}{guide_note}\n"
"Accept or decline by {deadline}:\n"
"{guest_link}"

msgid "Gegenangebot angenommen"
msgstr "Proposal accepted"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat dein Angebot angenommen:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} has accepted your proposal:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Danke! Deine Buchung ist bestätigt:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{billing_hint}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you! Your booking is confirmed:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{billing_hint}"

msgid "Gegenangebot abgelehnt"
msgstr "Proposal declined"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat dein Angebot abgelehnt. Die Tage sind wieder frei.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} has declined your proposal. The days are free again.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Leider kann {guide} deine Anfrage nicht annehmen.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately {guide} cannot accept your request.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}"

msgid "Buchung vom Gast storniert"
msgstr "Booking cancelled by guest"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat storniert. Die Tage sind wieder frei.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} has cancelled. The days are free again.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deine Tour am {start} wurde abgesagt"
msgstr "Your tour on {start} has been cancelled"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} musste die Tour leider absagen. Für dich entstehen keine Kosten.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}\n"
"Bei Fragen: {guide_email}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately {guide} had to cancel the tour. There is no charge for you.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}\n"
"Questions: {guide_email}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deine Buchung bei {guide} wurde geändert"
msgstr "Your booking with {guide} has changed"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} hat deine Buchung angepasst:\n"
"\n"
"{changes}\n"
"\n"
"Neu:\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}\n"
"Passt etwas nicht? Melde dich bei {guide_email}.\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} has changed your booking:\n"
"\n"
"{changes}\n"
"\n"
"Now:\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}\n"
"Something not right? Contact {guide_email}.\n"
"{guest_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ersatzdatum für {tour}"
msgstr "Replacement date for {tour}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} muss die Tour wegen Wetter oder Verhältnissen verschieben und schlägt ein Ersatzdatum vor:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}{costs_note}\n"
"Bitte sag bis {deadline} zu oder ab. Wenn das Datum nicht passt oder du nicht antwortest, wird die Buchung kostenlos storniert{refund_note}.\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide} has to move the tour because of the weather or conditions and proposes a replacement date:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guide_note}{costs_note}\n"
"Please accept or decline by {deadline}. If the date doesn't suit you or you don't reply, the booking is cancelled free of charge{refund_note}.\n"
"{guest_link}"

msgid "Ersatzdatum angenommen"
msgstr "Replacement date accepted"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat das Ersatzdatum angenommen:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} has accepted the replacement date:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

msgid "Ersatzdatum abgelehnt – Buchung storniert"
msgstr "Replacement date declined – booking cancelled"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat das Ersatzdatum abgelehnt oder nicht rechtzeitig geantwortet. Die Buchung ist storniert.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} declined the replacement date or didn't reply in time. The booking is cancelled.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deine Buchung bei {guide} ist storniert"
msgstr "Your booking with {guide} is cancelled"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Das Ersatzdatum hat nicht gepasst, deine Buchung ist storniert.{refund_note}\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"The replacement date didn't work out, your booking is cancelled.{refund_note}\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guest_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Rechnung für deine Tour vom {start}"
msgstr "Invoice for your tour on {start}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Hier ist die Abrechnung von {guide}:\n"
"\n"
"{invoice}\n"
"{vat_line}{guide_note}\n"
"{payment_instructions}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Here is the invoice from {guide}:\n"
"\n"
"{invoice}\n"
"{vat_line}{guide_note}\n"
"{payment_instructions}"

msgid "Zahlungsbeleg – vielen Dank"
msgstr "Payment receipt – thank you"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Vielen Dank, deine Zahlung ist eingegangen.\n"
"\n"
"{receipt}\n"
"\n"
"Kontakt Bergführer: {guide}, {guide_email} {guide_phone}\n"
"\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, we have received your payment.\n"
"\n"
"{receipt}\n"
"\n"
"Your mountain guide: {guide}, {guide_email} {guide_phone}\n"
"\n"
"{guest_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Zahlung erhalten für {dates}"
msgstr "Payment received for {dates}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat bezahlt.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} has paid.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deine Anfrage bei {guide} ist abgelaufen"
msgstr "Your request to {guide} has expired"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Die Frist ist abgelaufen, die Buchung wurde nicht abgeschlossen.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"The deadline has passed and the booking was not completed.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}"

msgid "Buchung abgelaufen"
msgstr "Booking expired"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"Diese Buchung ist abgelaufen, die Tage sind wieder frei.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"Gast: {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"This booking has expired, the days are free again.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"Guest: {guest}\n"
"\n"
"{guide_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Anmeldung bestätigt: {tour} am {start}"
msgstr "Sign-up confirmed: {tour} on {start}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Du bist angemeldet – vielen Dank!\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"Treffpunkt:     {meeting}\n"
"Entscheid:      {guide} entscheidet bis {decision_deadline}, ob die Tour stattfindet. Fällt sie aus, erhältst du den vollen Betrag automatisch zurück.\n"
"\n"
"Anforderungen:\n"
"{requirements}\n"
"\n"
"Ausrüstung:\n"
"{equipment}\n"
"\n"
"Inbegriffen:\n"
"{included}\n"
"\n"
"Bergführer: {guide}, Telefon {guide_phone}, {guide_email}\n"
"\n"
"{receipt}\n"
"\n"
"Deine Anmeldung, Stornieren und Bedingungen:\n"
"{guest_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"You're signed up – thank you!\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"Meeting point:  {meeting}\n"
"Decision:       {guide} decides by {decision_deadline} whether the tour goes ahead. If it doesn't, you get the full amount back automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Requirements:\n"
"{requirements}\n"
"\n"
"Equipment:\n"
"{equipment}\n"
"\n"
"Included:\n"
"{included}\n"
"\n"
"Guide: {guide}, phone {guide_phone}, {guide_email}\n"
"\n"
"{receipt}\n"
"\n"
"Your sign-up, cancellation and terms:\n"
"{guest_link}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Neue Anmeldung: {tour} am {start}"
msgstr "New sign-up: {tour} on {start}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} hat {participants} Platz/Plätze gebucht und bezahlt.\n"
"\n"
"Angemeldet: {seats_taken} von {max_participants} (Mindestzahl {min_participants}).\n"
"\n"
"{departure_link}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guide}\n"
"\n"
"{guest} has booked and paid {participants} seat(s).\n"
"\n"
"Signed up: {seats_taken} of {max_participants} (minimum {min_participants}).\n"
"\n"
"{departure_link}"

msgid "Anmeldung nicht möglich – Betrag zurückbezahlt"
msgstr "Sign-up not possible – amount refunded"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Deine Zahlung kam an, als die Plätze schon vergeben waren. Wir haben dir den vollen Betrag zurückbezahlt; er erscheint in einigen Tagen auf deiner Karte.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Your payment arrived after the seats had been taken. We have refunded the full amount; it will show on your card in a few days.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}"

msgid "Anmeldung nicht abgeschlossen"
msgstr "Sign-up not completed"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Die Zahlung für deine Anmeldung wurde nicht abgeschlossen, deshalb sind die Plätze nicht reserviert.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"Sind noch Plätze frei, kannst du dich hier erneut anmelden:\n"
"{departure_url}"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"The payment for your sign-up was not completed, so the seats are not reserved.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"If there are still seats, you can sign up again here:\n"
"{departure_url}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Stornierung bestätigt: {tour} am {start}"
msgstr "Cancellation confirmed: {tour} on {start}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hallo {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Deine Anmeldung ist storniert.\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"\n"
"Storno-Kosten gemäss Bedingungen: {percent} % = CHF {fee}\n"
"Rückzahlung: CHF {refund} (erscheint in einigen Tagen auf deiner Karte)"
msgstr ""
"Hello {guest}\n"
"\n"
"Your sign-up is cancelled.\n"
"\n"
